  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就決定是怪顎龍囉！\n暴君寶可夢也太帥了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C316C7A5B9A662F602A984E9F8D56C9FF01000A66B4541B5BF653EF59224E5F592A5E254E86300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哥哥你是那樣說，\n可是冰雪巨龍也很強啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E554E54F60662F90A36A238AAAFF0C000A53EF662F51B096EA5DE89F8D4E5F5F885F37554A300200100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "訓練家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐，\n怪顎龍和冰雪巨龍，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳覺得哪隻比較好呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A137DF45BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0FF0C000A602A984E9F8D548C51B096EA5DE89F8DFF0C00100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B389BA5F9754EA96BB6BD48F03597D5462FF1F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這干陌生人什麼事！\n我們現在要去買的是顎之化石！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195E72964C751F4EBA4EC09EBC4E8BFF01000A6211501173FE5728898153BB8CB77684662F984E4E4B531677F3FF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且明明就是我來決定\n想和什麼寶可夢當夥伴！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我才不用聽琪琪怎麼說呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14660E660E5C31662F62114F866C7A5B9A000A60F3548C4EC09EBC5BF653EF5922757659254F34FF0100100001BE01000A6211624D4E0D7528807D742A742A600E9EBC8AAA5462FF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哥哥你好壞！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E554E54F60597D58DEFF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "訓練家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓他看看冰雪巨龍有多強好不好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A137DF45BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B934ED6770B770B51B096EA5DE89F8D6709591A5F37597D4E0D597D300200100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請用1隻冰雪巨龍\n打贏我哥哥的寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7528003196BB51B096EA5DE89F8D000A62538D0F621154E554E576845BF653EF5922FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我對冰雪巨龍很熟悉！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我知道把鰭之化石復原成冰雪龍，\n然後培育牠，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n牠就會進化成冰雪巨龍！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C0D51B096EA5DE89F8D5F88719F6089FF0100100001BE01000A621177E59053628A9C2D4E4B531677F35FA9539F621051B096EA9F8DFF0C000A71365F8C57F980B27260FF0C00100001BE00000A72605C31670390325316621051B096EA5DE89F8DFF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳做好用1隻冰雪巨龍對戰的準備，\n就請跟我說一聲！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B3505A597D7528003196BB51B096EA5DE89F8D5C0D623076846E965099FF0C000A5C318ACB8DDF62118AAA4E008072FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我對冰雪巨龍很熟悉！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把鰭之化石復原成冰雪龍，\n然後培育牠，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n牠就會進化成冰雪巨龍！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請用1隻這樣的冰雪巨龍來對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C0D51B096EA5DE89F8D5F88719F6089FF0100100001BE01000A628A9C2D4E4B531677F35FA9539F621051B096EA9F8DFF0C000A71365F8C57F980B27260FF0C00100001BE00000A72605C31670390325316621051B096EA5DE89F8DFF0100100001BE01000A8ACB7528003196BB90196A23768451B096EA5DE89F8D4F865C0D6230FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想和我對戰，\n就只帶1隻冰雪巨龍來吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n畢竟那才是我妹妹要的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F3548C62115C0D6230FF0C000A5C3153EA5E36003196BB51B096EA5DE89F8D4F865427300200100001BE00000A75627ADF90A3624D662F621159B959B989817684300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓隊伍裡只有1隻冰雪巨龍了呢！\n現在可以對戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B93968A4F0D88E153EA6709003196BB51B096EA5DE89F8D4E865462FF01000A73FE572853EF4EE55C0D623055CEFF1F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我準備一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116E9650994E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要證明實力有多強的話，\n做好準備也是很重要的吧……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818B49660E5BE6529B6709591A5F3776848A71FF0C000A505A597D6E9650994E5F662F5F8891CD89817684542720262026FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了要證明實力有多強，\n我們是不會手下留情的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8689818B49660E5BE6529B6709591A5F37FF0C000A62115011662F4E0D6703624B4E0B755960C57684FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我才不管<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她是個什麼樣的人，\n也不管冰雪巨龍到底有多強，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n反正我的寶可夢就是比較強！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211624D4E0D7BA100100003110000FF01014ED65979662F500B4EC09EBC6A2376844EBAFF0C000A4E5F4E0D7BA151B096EA5DE89F8D52305E956709591A5F37FF0C00100001BE00000A53CD6B63621176845BF653EF59225C31662F6BD48F035F37FF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好棒！好棒！\n果然冰雪巨龍很強呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D68D2FF01597D68D2FF01000A679C713651B096EA5DE89F8D5F885F375462FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這下子你也認了對吧！\n哥哥！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E0B5B504F604E5F8A8D4E865C0D5427FF01000A54E554E5FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是冰雪巨龍強，\n是訓練家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐強啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F51B096EA5DE89F8D5F37FF0C000A662F8A137DF45BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D05F375566FF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說、說不定是那樣啦……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA30018AAA4E0D5B9A662F90A36A2355662026202600100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，下次就由琪琪妳\n用冰雪巨龍去對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C4E0B6B215C317531742A742A59B3000A752851B096EA5DE89F8D53BB5C0D62305427300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不然哪能證明\n冰雪巨龍有多強啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D713654EA80FD8B49660E000A51B096EA5DE89F8D6709591A5F37554AFF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAA2026202600100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是說，我幫妳買鰭之化石，\n所以妳要好好培育牠。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F8AAAFF0C62115E6B59B38CB79C2D4E4B531677F3FF0C000A62404EE559B38981597D597D57F980B27260300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "訓練家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐！\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意和我哥哥對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A137DF45BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0FF01000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F548C621154E554E55C0D6230FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會培育出\n世界第一的冰雪巨龍的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670357F980B251FA000A4E16754C7B2C4E00768451B096EA5DE89F8D7684FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請多指教囉！\n我的冰雪龍！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB591A6307655956C9FF01000A6211768451B096EA9F8DFF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和琪琪她的對戰可是\n怪顎龍對上冰雪巨龍啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C742A742A597976845C0D623053EF662F000A602A984E9F8D5C0D4E0A51B096EA5DE89F8D554A300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    }
